    2. Pick num_rects in {2,3}
    3. For each rect, pick h in [3, min(H,11)] and w in [3, min(W,11)]
    4. Place rects on grid with no overlap and min 1-cell bg gap between any two
       (greedy placement with rejection; retry if placement fails)
    5. Fill each rect region with fg=1, rest bg=0
    6. Validate: exactly one foreground color, all components are solid rectangles
```
